# This repository's text is LF, everywhere, whoever checks it out.
#
# Git rewrites line endings on checkout by default, so on Windows every source
# file arrives with CRLF -- and `gofmt -l` then reports EVERY file as
# unformatted. The Windows lane found it, which is the only lane that could.
* text=auto eol=lf

# And fixtures are not text at all: they must be the same BYTES on every
# machine. A witness a checkout may edit is not a witness.
testdata/** -text
